    "reading-failed-send-too-large" : {
      "comment" : "Why Send to e-reader stopped before sending: the file it made is bigger than the e-reader or its service takes. File is the file's name, target the e-reader's name such as Kindle. Shown with Try again. Argument 1: file (Text). Argument 2: target (Text). Argument 3: size (Bytes). Argument 4: limit (Bytes).",
